<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	b) Using the navigator on the left-hand-side of the screen, select View By Supplier (see image below).  Note that the green arrow is pointing to the word "Current FY".  This means that only orders from this Fiscal Year are being displayed.  If you want to search all available years, click on the Current FY button.</run></par>
